  "description": "(3.0.1) Content-policy / refusal contracts — pattern-adoption of Sponsio. Distinct from the v1.2.0 CircleAI.Safety personal-safety domain pack. IContentFilter (pre-completion guardrails) + IRefusalPolicy + IPromptInjectionDetector (second-order attacks via RAG/web/tool output) + ISafetyAuditLog. Null impls fail-closed (treat everything as refused, log nothing). Real backends in 3.0.2. Renamed from CircleAI.Guardrails 3.0.0 — that package ID exists on nuget.org but is a dead-end; nothing newer will ship under that ID. New consumers: `dotnet add package CircleAI.ContentPolicy`.",
